# Apple MapKit JS token (optional) — when present, PostJob's address
# field uses Apple's autocomplete to populate street/city/zip in one
# tap. When missing, the page falls back to plain text inputs. Token
# is a JWT signed with a MapKit private key from a Maps ID in Apple
# Developer (Certificates -> Identifiers -> Services -> Maps).
# See https://developer.apple.com/documentation/mapkitjs
VITE_APPLE_MAPKIT_TOKEN=""
